{
    "background_story": "In the primordial depths of the ocean, a single zygote held the promise of a new era. This tiny cell, infused with the essence of the sea, would give rise to Titan, a being of unimaginable power. As the zygote divided and grew, it absorbed the surrounding energies, incorporating the strength of the currents and the wisdom of the ancient sea creatures. Titan's development was a gradual unfolding of wonder, its cells differentiating into majestic wings, shimmering scales, and eyes that burned with an inner fire. When finally born, Titan rose from the depths, a colossal dragon with the power to shape the oceans themselves. Its roar thundered through the waves, a call to a new era of harmony between the sea and its inhabitants. Titan's existence was a testament to the magic that lay within the simplest of beginnings \u2013 a single, mighty zygote.",
